window.products.push({"id":1168038,"name":"DOWILLDO Portable Air Conditioner for Personal, 3 Speeds Mini Air Conditioner Fan with 880ML Water Tank, 7 Colors Night Light, Evaporative Air Cooler ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DguZaLPdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【FAST COOLING MINI AIR CONDITIONER】: Three adjustable wind speeds (low/medium/high). After adding ice water or ice cubes, it can quickly and effectively cool the dry and hot air around you within 5s. The air conditioner portable unit can also be used as a cool mist humidifier, allowing you to enjoy a humid summer. 🧊【PORTABLE AIR CONDITIONERS】: Portable design - it won't take up a lot of space and can be easily taken anywhere, such as camping and sports. In summer, our portable air conditioner is your best choice for small rooms, homes, offices, outdoor picnics, etc. 🧊【LOWER NOISE, BETTER SLEEP】: This powerful silent small air conditioner is expertly engineered to produce little noise(only 40dB!). The low noise motor is suitable for your quiet office or reading, and suitable for your baby to sleep comfortably. Easy to use by only one button for good night’s sleep or cool nap during hot summer nights, for room, bedroom, study and office. 🧊【7 COLOR NIGHT LIGHT】:Small portable air conditioner with 7 Different Color-Cycle! You can pick on your favorite color to suit your mood and atmosphere, soft light, make your room more beautiful and romatic, create an ideal sleeping environment. 🧊【880ML LARGE CAPACITY WATER TANK】: Compared with other 300-400ml portable air conditioners, ANGORADO 880ml mini air conditioner can last all night (2-10 hours), avoiding frequent refilling of water or ice water. Continuous spraying of cold air for several hours keeps the body cool at night and gets a good sleep. 🧊【ECO-FRIENDLY & ENERGY SAVING】:Compared to traditional Freon air conditioners, it saves at least 90% of electricity in the summer. The air conditioner with water for naturally cooled and humidified air, without any harmful chemicals. It has passed certifications according to CE, FCC, ROHS, PSE and air conditioning system is made of BPA-free material, guarantees the health of children and adults.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DguZaLPdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWILLDO","source_asin":"B0B84DDM33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B84DDM33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B84DDM33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
