window.products.push({"id":1168426,"name":"Custom Canvas Prints With Your Photos 12\"x8\" - Customize With Your Own Picture and/or Text - 0.75\" Wooden Frame - Personalized Photo To Canvas Print W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4wqtJuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized canvas prints for your home: we combine your best memories captured in photographs with our state of the art technologies and materials to create breathtaking and unique wall decorations Gallery Wrapped Edges: the canvas photo print is wrapped around the frame, however we do not cut any of your uploaded image for the edges, instead we add the extra inch necessary for the borders using some pixels from the edges of your image and creating a border Image Resolution: a resolution of at least 90 DPI is needed. For best results, your digital camera resolution should not be under 4 megapixels. Please use the \"\"JPEG\"\" file format Attention: The final print corresponds exactly to its respective preview that you will see during the customization process using the Amazon tool. If any white borders are left on the edges, try adjusting the image in the customization tool, otherwise they will be printed on the final product Best price & service performance: turn your photo into an artwork in gallery quality. With Photo Gifts your custom canvas print will be produced using the latest printing technology and convince with outstanding sharpness and intense colors. Each wall art piece arrives securely packed in a cardboard box and wrapped to hold it stable and avoid shipment damage Brand Quality: produced by one of the world’s leading wall décor manufacturers Made in USA: real handcrafted custom canvas prints produced and hand-stretched in Miami or Phoenix UV-resistant colors: long-lasting vibrant, saturated colors Solvent-free Ink: odorless and can be used by someone with allergies and in kids’ rooms Certified artist grade canvas (300g/m²): especially created for wall art prints on canvas Light-weight wooden frame: even the large formats can easily be hung on a regular nail You will receive the finest quality from us because we settle for nothing less!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4wqtJuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Photo.Gifts","source_asin":"B01FQU71BO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FQU71BO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FQU71BO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
