window.products.push({"id":1168474,"name":"Set of 5 Succulents Fake Plants Bedroom Aesthetic Small Fake Plants Bathroom - Mini Fake Plants Decor for Office Desk Decor - Tiny Realistic Fake Succ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nNeInmldL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO GREEN THUMB, NO PROBLEM - If cactus is the only plant you can seem to keep alive for more than a few weeks and the number of plant skeletons in your closet is embarrassingly high, you'll love the convenience of our lifelike yet totally unkillable artificial succulents. You'll get all the visual benefits of a real plant without all that pesky dying stuff and most importantly, your friends and family won't call you the green reaper behind your back anymore (the audacity!). TEXTURED FOR ADDED REALISM - Unlike other fake succulents that aren't so subtle about looking rubbery and artificial, our mini faux plants feature beautiful details for a more natural appearance and are potted in minimalistic paper mache containers for a rustic-modern feel. They're the perfect way to bring the outdoors straight to your living room! NO MAINTENANCE NEEDED - Love everything about real plants but hate the idea of watering, pruning, weeding, and GASP getting calluses all over your soft, supple hands? If you're not a fan of manual labor, artificial plants are a fantastic way to add a bit of greenery to your home without all the effort of taking care of live house plants! ADD NATURAL VIBES TO ANY ROOM - Looking for a way to liven up your home without spending a fortune decorating? Our fake succulent plants are just the right size for shelf decor and make the perfect centerpieces for dining room tables. They're also great for spicing up kitchen tables, foyers, windows, college dorms, TV stands, bathtub corners and tons more! SMALL & LIGHTWEIGHT FOR EASY STYLING - Our mini succulent plants are just the right size for no-fuss decorating. Each fake plant is approximately 2.25 inches L x 2.25 inches H x 2.25 inches W and features a lightweight base for hassle-free rearranging. NOTE: Pot base is made of paper mache and is not waterproof. Do not place in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nNeInmldL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophia's Garden","source_asin":"B07RWVW2ZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RWVW2ZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RWVW2ZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1168475,"name":"ecoZen Lifestyle Grill Apron for Men Funny I Perfect Mens Aprons for Grilling BBQ and Cooking in Kitchen I Ideal Fathers Day Gift for Dad or Husband f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614AN9aKn8S._AC_SL1438_.jpg","description":"BECOMING A VEGETARIAN IS A BIG MISSED STEAK! Steal the Show Spark rib-cracking laughter as you serve those ribs! The perfect treat for the pitmaster with a great sense of humor, this funny aprons for men is just what you need to break the ice and fill your next BBQ with smiles. Thinking of getting this Becoming a Vegetarian is a Big Missed Steak apron as a gift? You’ve got good taste! And they are sure to love it. It’s been known to make dads beam on Father’s Day, make boyfriends giddy on birthdays, make grilling lovers tear up a bit on Christmas, and even make that hard-to-please fathers-in-law chuckle in approval. Quality You’ll Love This isn’t just any funny grilling aprons for men; it’s a serving of durable hilarity. See, most printed aprons are created using cheap wax graphics that flake after a couple of washes and start chipping just a few BBQs in. We’ve taken the high-quality route instead. Thanks to silk-like laser-printing, the graphics remain crisp, vivid, and intact even after multiple stints in the wash. Follow the care instructions on the label and you’ll still be sparking bursts of laughter ages down the line. Here are more reasons to love the ecoZen Lifestyle funny apron: - Designed with deep pockets to conveniently hold grilling tools. - Made of thick yet breathable cotton fabric for protection and comfort. - Measures 27” x 29” to fully cover the front and offer splatter protection. - Adjustable at the neck to change the length without messy tying. - The long 45” waist ties suit men, women, and bigger guys. - Backed by an extended 90-day money-back guarantee for complete peace of mind. Go ahead, treat yourself or that special someone to a mens apron that never skimps on quality!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614AN9aKn8S._AC_SL1438_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecoZen Lifestyle","source_asin":"B08G3JSRG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G3JSRG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G3JSRG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
