window.products.push({"id":1168489,"name":"ST. BRIDGE Flannel Fleece Throw Blanket,Super Cozy Lightweight Bed Blanket Microfiber Fuzzy Soft Blanket Warm Plush Blanket for Bed Couch Sofa(60\"x80\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PBEZ9Y1RL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Throw Blanket is used widely in everyday life, a comfortable blanket would perfect your whole day once you cuddle yourself in softness and warmth at the end of a day.The cozy and soft flannel fleece throw blanket can be as a decorative blanket in home decor. They can decorate the home by being artistically draped over simple chair ,sofa or bed, and can also be a excellent gift idea for any member of the family to provide warmth. Product Description Material:100% microfiber polyester . Blanket Size:50\"x60\" or 60\"x80\"  Four Color Options:Pink, Beige ,Grey,Blue Versatile & Applicable Being enough weight to keep you comfortable and warm, but not feel too hot.The luxurious bed blanket is suitable for all seasons. There are many ways to use plush throw blanket,it can be used as sofa blanket, bed blanket, outdoor blanket , camping blanket ,travel blanket,car blanket and more. Use as outdoor blanket- Throw is great for outdoor use as well, is easily portable, and provides the perfect warmth for camping at night or picnic during the day. Use as sofa throw - On a rainy weekend , reading or watching TV with your family, wrap up in sofa/ couch,This is a great enjoyment. Use as bed blanket or lap blanket- When you are tired after work, this bed throw blanket will keep you warm in an air-conditioned environment and let you have a good rest. Applicable to various occasions: bedroom, living room, office, car and more. Care Instruction The flannel fuzzy blanket is lightweight ,warm and easy to carry .Machine wash with cold water separately on gentle cycle Only, Tumble Dry Low. Please Note 1.All dimensions are manually measured with a possible deviation of 2-3 cm.  2.The digital images are as accurate as possible. Actual colors may vary slightly due to differences in display settings and lightings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PBEZ9Y1RL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ST. BRIDGE","source_asin":"B07T5QVC78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T5QVC78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T5QVC78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
