window.products.push({"id":1168619,"name":"FIVEGIVEN 5 Tier Ladder Book Shelf Tall Bookshelf Modern Open Wood Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RSAVTAGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[About the APPLICATION SCENES] In the living room Create a lovely place in your living room with this open bookshelf and displaying items like gorgeous family photos, previous travelling mementos and eye-catching knick-knacks would be a great fun. In the office Organize books and important documents on the shelves, then embellish it with some stylish collectibles, this standing book shelf would become functional and decorative furniture in your office. [About the PRODUCT FEATURES] - This display shelf has minimalist design of slightly curved side frames and 5 tier backless shelves- 2 front feet can be adjusted to ensure this tall bookshelf stand evenly- X supporting bar on the backside adds the extra stability- Anti-tipping set of ribbon and drywall screws is provided to anchor this 5 shelf ladder bookcase to the wall for safety [About the PRODUCT DATA] Frame material: metal coated with black sandy finishShelf material: particle boards (not solid wood) with espresso melamine veneeringNumber of shelves: 5 shelvesOrientation: verticalDimension: 26.2\"(W)*14.5\"(D)*53.7\"(H), please refer to the product photo for more detailed dimensionsWeight capacity: 100lbs per shelf, evenly distributedGross weight: 31.6lbsColor option: espresso/Sonoma cherry [About the ASSEMBLY and MAINTAINS] The assembly is required, and all you need is a Philippe screwdriver and 30 minutes. Simple and clear instruction is provided and all parts including the hardware have been letter labeled [About FIVEGIVEN] From the day one it was born, FIVEGIVEN is devoted to provide high quality products for both home and office environment.  We pursuit simple but elegant and fashion design, with thoughtful function, to make your home and office life stylish and comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RSAVTAGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIVEGIVEN","source_asin":"B07CQLF6N7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQLF6N7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQLF6N7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
