window.products.push({"id":1168633,"name":"Digital Food Cooking & Meat Thermometer| Instant Read, Electric, Mini Foldable Kitchen Probe for Steak, BBQ, Grill, Candy, Oven/Smoker/Home Cooking| P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tCza4MxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOFEZ Instant Temp Reading Thermometer There’s a reason why people go to restaurants to get the perfect steak, done professionally by a chef, at hefty prices. Because perfectly cooked meat, simply does not compare to the average cook’s results. What if, however, you could enjoy the perfectly cooked meat, at home, anytime, whenever you wished, for only the price of one, restaurant-worthy stake? Introducing the MOFEZ Digital Thermometer Our digital thermometer equips you with everything you need to take your culinary skills to a new plateau of deliciousness: ➤ Robust ABS plastic body ➤ IP67 Waterproof certification ➤ Instant & precise temp read within 2-5 seconds ➤ Backlit dial screen ➤ Celsius & Fahrenheit readings ➤ Min/Max temperature reading save capability ➤ Meat temperature guide laminated on the body ➤ Stainless Steel probe ➤ Handy loop hole for easy storage ➤ Heavy-Duty, Long-Lasting Battery life Our thermometer features interior magnets for easy placement on metallic surfaces, comes with easy-to-read instructions as well as a clean, 5-step recalibration guide. Plus, with all your purchases, we give you a bonus Meat Temperature Guide chart to consult for cooking the perfect meat! The Perfect Feast, Every Single Time Enjoy perfectly cooked burgers, steaks, roast chicken, lasagna, turkey, oven cooked dishes, fish or anything your heart desires. Whether you’re at home, chilling over a BBQ/ Grill/ Smoker with friends and family or enjoying a laid-back weekend camping in the great outdoors over a campfire- the MOFEZ digital thermometer will be your dependable companion for location-independent, jaw-dropping cooking. Click Add To Cart Today & Become A Chef On Your Own!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tCza4MxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOFEZ","source_asin":"B07QGR19DN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QGR19DN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QGR19DN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
