window.products.push({"id":1168822,"name":"Aililife 3D DIY Wall Clock Acrylic Mirror Surface Mirror Frameless Large DIY Wall Clock Kit for Home Living Room Bedroom Office Decoration (Black-3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJM2oBDvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"3D DIY Wall Clock Modern Frameless Large 3D DIY Wall Clock Kit Decoration for Home Living Room Bedroom Warm Tips: 1. The wall clock numbers and hands have a protective film, please tear it off after installation. 2. Please hang the clock on the wall, wait for 10~30 minutes to check the minute hand move well. Specifications : Material: EVA foam stickers,acrylic,alloy clock face  Hour hand: 31cm /12\" Minute hand: 39cm / 15.3\" Clock machine: 12cm/ 4.7\" Time accuracy: -0.8~+1.2second/day Number Size:3.23\" The minimum achieving is: 63cm x 63cm / 24.8\" x 24.8\". Weight:0.47kg. Power: 1*AA battery (not included)  Package Included:  1 x DIY Wall Clock Kit Without Battery How to install: Step1 :Use a hammer to knock the nail into wall,then hang clock tray on the wall Step2 :Hang the paper scale on the clock tray, according to the scale to mark numbers’ position Step3 :Remove the paper from back of acrylic mirrors,then fit with matching EVA Step4 : Remove the back paper of EVA;stick to the wall Step5 :Tear off the protective films from mirrors Step6 :Fix the hour hand and minute hand one by one along the 12 o’clock position Step7 :Tighten the nut Step8 :Install a carbon AA battery for clock,adjust the time with gear button of quartz Step9 :Hanging the clock return to wall.Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now  Our Service: We offer customers a guarantee of 30 days money back and 2 Years warranty from date of purchase, If the DIY clock has any problems, you can get a free replacement without a return. Please feel free to leave us a message if you have any questions. We will reply to you within 24 hours and offer you our best services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJM2oBDvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILILIFE","source_asin":"B07QCMCW48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QCMCW48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QCMCW48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1168823,"name":"Flyart St Patricks Day Decorations St Patricks Day Table Runner Lucky Charmed Blessed Clover Shamrock Table Runner, Seasonal Plaid St. Patrick's Day f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814vfS9RXcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester ☘【Unique Design St. Patricks Day Decor】- Happy st. patrick's day！Welcome to choose our tablecloth mat for indoor or outdoor! Our st patrick table runner with a rustic styles of green background, featuring leprechaun and gnomes, LUCKY Word and Shamrocks gold pot coins patterns design. our saint patricks runners for tables are simple yet cute for you to match your party theme to make your party more lively. ☘【Durable High Quality & Easy Care】- Our st patricks day table runner are made of 100% spun polyester, sturdy sewing, soft and durable. Machine wash separately in cold water and quick drying, circulate gently, and dry at low temperature. No bleaching, No fading. Sometimes the fabric is wrinkled during transportation. Use a warm iron with steam, wrinkles will disappear immediately with a perfectly flat and refreshing shamrock decor table runner! 【Optional Size to Meet Needs】- Our St. patricks day table decoration provide multiple sizes for you to choose according to your needs. This burlap lucky shamrocks table runner is Wx L=13\" x 72\", appropriate for a dining table that can seat 4-6 people, better match your table and give you a unforgettable and happy St. Patrick's Day dining experience. ☘【Multi-Purpose St. patricks Day Table Decoration】- You can use this st patrick's day dresser runner in the dining room, foyer, console or coffee table or on the surface of furniture to prevent from hot pans, scratches, and spills, easy to match and clean; This happy st patricks table runner is smooth, comfortable, remove stains, no harmful plastic, which is a practical irish decorations for delicate life at home. ☘【Use Occasions】- This st patrick's green buffalo check linen table runner with Lucky shamrocks, Shamrocks Leprechaun Gnomes full of Luck, create a strong St. Patrick's Day atmosphere. It is perfect for rectangle table decorative. Nice for food buffet, Weddings, Birthday party, dinner decoration, also good for any irish and st.patrick's theme party, such as bridal shower, baby shower, holidays, farmhouse kitchen or other occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814vfS9RXcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLYART","source_asin":"B0BN2X3FQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN2X3FQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN2X3FQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
