window.products.push({"id":1168942,"name":"LaserGram 20oz Vacuum Insulated Tumbler Mug, Horseshoe with Horse, Personalized Engraving Included (Faux Leather, Rustic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610BrqC2NYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a daily travel partner? This mug will do the the job, whether you're on your way to the office, school, or even a long road trip. Personalized just the way you want it! Each travel mug is laser engraved with the image that you see in the photo along with your own name or custom text. Coffee? Tea? Juice? This mug can handle it all, Hot or Cold! Its double-wall insulated stainless steel construction will keep 20 ounces of your favorite drink hot or cold for hours! Give it as a gift to someone special or give it to your friends at the office. Imagine the look on their face when they see their own name engraved right on the mug! The synthetic leather wrap provides a comfortable and safe grip. Comes with a snug fitting lid to help prevent spills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610BrqC2NYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaserGram","source_asin":"B07SD5MWZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SD5MWZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SD5MWZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1168943,"name":"GXQQ Mermaid Octopus Canvas Wall Art, Kraken Bathroom Decor, Modern Vintage Wall Decor for Bedroom Bathroom, Nautical Ocean Theme Art Posters and Prin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UmfadRZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton 【UNIQUE DESIGN】 Be surrounded by the sea, a beautiful mermaid with golden tail is looking at her good friend, a mysterious octopus lovingly, which is sweet and whimsical. Combined with the vintage but elegant blue and yellow color, our cute mermaid wall art will refresh your home and add a warm and vivid touch to your home decor. The unique design also makes it a nice gift choice for your ‎housewarming, white elephant or other big days 【PREMIUM QUALITY】 Our canvas wall decor is professionally hand stretched and wrapped around the wooden frame. Made of high-quality cotton canvas and solid wood frame, the wall decor has strong elasticity, which is durable and not easy to crack. By the HD printing technology, the whole picture looks more exquisite and vivid. Also, all the ink we use is ECO-solvent, which is odorless and more environment-friendly 【LOVED BY EVERYONE】 Our beautiful mermaid artwork is a great additon to your living room, bathroom or bedroom, goes perfectly with mermaid theme or other different themes like octopus, ocean, under the sea or nautical decor. Also, by girl's nature, it also fit your daughter's room well. We believe the painting with classic mermaid & octopus design can show your real flair on home decor, and bring you smiles even after a busy working day 【EASY INSTALLATION AND DISPLAY】 Perfect size and lightweight design for easy installation. The mounting hardware (A pair of gloves/ metal hook x 1/ plastic hook x 1/ Seamless Nail x 2) is included, take it out of the box and it's ready to hang after the easy installation. Fix the metal hook to the back of the wall art, then fix the plastic hook to the wall by two small nails, finally just hang the picture to show 【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】 GXQQ canvas wall art provide you sincere and superior customer service. If you have any questions or expectations, please contact us and we will reply as soon as possible within 12 hours. We also provide the full refunds within 30 days if you're not 100% satisfied with our products","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UmfadRZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GXQQ","source_asin":"B08C9KHDKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9KHDKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9KHDKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
