window.products.push({"id":1168963,"name":"LiyuanQ Ice Cube Trays with Lids, Silicone Ice Cube Molds Trays 3 Pack Flexible Easy Release Small Square Ice Tray 111 Cavities Food Grade Stackable I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iNPslRGwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Unique Hexagon Trays Design】 111 Honeycomb cubes comes with removable tray with lids, it allows you to make nice cubes while spills and the freezing of excess water ice cubes from contamination of other smells or flavors in your freezer. Ice cube trays can stack one on top of the other or nested inside each other to save cabinet, refrigerator, or freezer space. Each tray makes 37 mini honeycomb shaped ice cubes. 【Easy To Wash】Our silicone ice mold stackable have a smooth silicone surface for easy using. Ice making tray is recommended to wash and thoroughly dry before first usage. Our ice trays with covers can also be washed in the dishwasher, convenience! 【Great Performance In High & Low Temperature Resistance】 It stands -40 to 230 degrees Celsius and is applicable to refrigerator and microwave. Ice cube trays with lids is mainly used in bars, restaurants or households to produce ice cubes. The ice cubes can be directly put into whisky, fruit juice, and beer to chill the drinks instantly. 【Great Flexibility】Our honeycomb ice cubes tray are made of silicone material. Silicone material is flexible and can restore immediately after being twisted. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. It will not stick together with the ice cubes during the icing process and helps release the ice cube more easily. 【Ice Trays With Lids Warm Tips】 Some buyers has reflected that it is difficult to take out ice cubes from the cube trays after freezing. It is recommended leaving on for 1-2 minutes after taking out the ice cubes from the refrigerator. When the ice cubes melt slightly (doesn't affect the food serving quality at all), then bend the ice tray towards the back side to remove the ice cubes. Press the back of tray with your fingers if necessary. It can help you take out all the mini ice cubes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iNPslRGwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiyuanQ","source_asin":"B08JLP28JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1168963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JLP28JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JLP28JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
